Provides: guitarix, guitarix-common, guitarix-lv2
Description: Rock guitar amplifier for JACK and PipeWire (kleag build)
 Guitarix is a virtual guitar amplifier for JACK or PipeWire (through
 pipewire-jack),
 with a headless engine, a GTK user interface and LV2 plugins.
 .
 This package is built from the kleag/guitarix fork. It contains the
 application, its data and the LV2 plugins, and replaces the split
 distribution packages.
